  "body_html": "<h1>liftCoeff_inr</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem liftCoeff_inr (A : I → Fin (n+1) → 𝕜) (p : PosRows A) (q : NegRows A) (i : I) : liftCoeff A (Sum.inr (p, q)) i = (if p.val = i then -A q.val (Fin.last n) else 0) + (if q.val = i then A p.val (Fin.last n) else 0)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>PosRows</li>\n<li>NegRows</li>\n<li>liftCoeff</li>\n</ul>",
